  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
